#. module: sale_order_calendar_state
#: model:mail.template,body_html:sale_order_calendar_state.email_template_delivery_date_changed
msgid ""
"\n"
"Dear ${object.partner_id.name},<br>\n"
"The expected delivery date has changed from ${object.commitment_date and object.commitment_date.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') or 'TBD'} to ${object.max_commitment_date.strftime('%d/%m/%Y')},\n"
"we hope this won't be a problem.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Best Regards,<br>\n"
"${user.name}\n"
"\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Spett.le ${object.partner_id.name},<br>\n"
"La data prevista di consegna è cambiata da ${object.commitment_date and object.commitment_date.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') or 'TBD'} a ${object.max_commitment_date.strftime('%d/%m/%Y')},\n"
"ci auguriamo non sia un problema.<br>\n"
"Cordialmente,<br>\n"
"${user.name}\n"
"\n"
"      "

